// Both sheet riders are dropped: "advantage against a target wearing metal
// armor" has no armor-material-check hook anywhere in combat resolution,
// and "the target can't take reactions until its next turn" has no
// reaction-suppression status in this real-time game (there is no reaction
// economy to suppress). Ships as a plain touch strike. Stab is used for
// the same reason as lightning_lure.ron -- no MeleeConstructorKind offers a
// real Lightning damage_kind, so the true in-engine damage type here is
// Piercing.
BasicMelee(
    energy_cost: 0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    swing_duration: 0.1,
    hit_timing: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    melee_constructor: (
        kind: Stab(damage: 16, poise: 5, knockback: 0, energy_regen: 0),
        range: 3.0,
        angle: 20.0,
    ),
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
